g\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/6/67/kxl4susmyxti0zntat0sot2gmo652uo.png/120px-%E6%9E%81%E9%99%90%E8%A7%A3%E6%94%BE_%E4%B8%B4%E6%88%98%E6%95%B4%E5%A4%87.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/6/67/kxl4susmyxti0zntat0sot2gmo652uo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />临战整备\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦物攻提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">5%</font>。<br />✦拥有的暴击率翻倍。<br />✦使用消耗<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>点及以上能量的技能前，自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲攻击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲攻击2</font></span></span>]、[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲暴击2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">▲暴击2</font></span></span>]及[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"▲协同伤害2\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">▲协同伤害2</font></span></span>]，所有效果持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合；使用技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"戍卫箭幕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">戍卫箭幕</font></span></span>]时，目标额外获得上述效果。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160